          ))}
          <div className="stat stat-wide">
            <strong>KENYA</strong>
            <span>Based in East Africa · Open to opportunities</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* ABOUT */}
        <section id="about" className="section about">
          <div className="section-heading">
            <span className="section-number">01 / ABOUT</span>
            <h2>Curiosity turned into code.</h2>
          </div>

          <div className="about-grid">
            <div className="about-lead">
              <p className="large-copy">
                I&apos;m interested in the intersection between{" "}
                <span>security</span>, <span>software</span> and{" "}
                <span>real-world problems</span>.
              </p>

              <p>
                My journey has taken me from learning cybersecurity and Linux
                environments to building complete applications with mobile
                interfaces, backend services, databases and cloud deployments.
              </p>

              <p>
                I enjoy understanding how systems work, finding where they can
                be improved, and then actually building the solution.
              </p>

              <button className="text-link" onClick={() => scrollTo("journey")}>
                See my journey <ArrowUpRight size={17} />
              </button>
            </div>

            <div className="about-panel">
              <div className="panel-label">CURRENTLY FOCUSED ON</div>
              <ul>
                <li>
                  <Check size={16} />
                  Cybersecurity & security engineering
                </li>
                <li>
                  <Check size={16} />
                  Full-stack application development
                </li>
                <li>
                  <Check size={16} />
                  Flutter mobile products
                </li>
                <li>
                  <Check size={16} />
                  Automation & AI-powered workflows
                </li>
              </ul>

              <div className="about-note">
                <span>01</span>
                <p>
                  The goal isn&apos;t just to write code. It&apos;s to build
                  something that people can actually use.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* MILESTONES */}
        <section id="milestones" className="section dark-section">
          <div className="section-heading light-heading">
            <span className="section-number">02 / MILESTONES</span>
            <h2>A journey of building.</h2>
          </div>

          <div className="milestone-layout">
            <div className="milestone-list">
              {milestones.map((item, index) => (
                <button
